85
00:06:47,073 --> 00:06:50,808
<i>Todos os lindos</i>

86
00:06:50,809 --> 00:06:54,680
<i>Cavalinhos</i>

87
00:07:11,628 --> 00:07:13,661
Eu vou chorar, sério.

88
00:07:14,063 --> 00:07:15,063
Beleza.

89
