Muito bem.

90
00:07:23,086 --> 00:07:27,165
<i>Todos os lindos cavalinhos</i>

91
00:07:27,166 --> 00:07:28,213
<i>Isso.</i>

92
00:07:28,578 --> 00:07:29,613
Beleza.

93
00:07:29,614 --> 00:07:32,455
